                             Zeus CallerStats

                                   v1.1

                            ©1996 by Rod Schnell


Description
~~~~~~~~~~~
  A Zdoor that displays an ANSI BBS usage graph based on the alltime number
  of calls per hour. Basically, it is an online version of the GUI CallerStat
  utility.


Usage
~~~~~
  CallerStats is a Zdoor and takes one required argument, the linenumber.

	Syntax: CallerStats <LINENUMBER>
	

Installation
~~~~~~~~~~~~
  Example menu entry...
  
    Option_C:
    RIPReset
    ClrScr
    ZDoor '"CallerStats 'Line'"'
    Signal MenuLoop


History
~~~~~~~
  v1.0 - First version.
       - Released in early May to beta testers on IRC #zeus.
  v1.1 - Released 14-May-96.
       - Made graphs shorter and added some extra information to
         the bottom.
       - Added line showing average calls per hour.
       - Several minor changes.


